WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.340
Speaker 1: We have to start today with yet another&nbsp;
defeat or failure for the so-called Anti-woke&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:10.200
movement. It's really important to understand that&nbsp;
all of these folks in the current American right&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:18.180
wing who insist that America is embroiled in a&nbsp;
culture war around which apparently the survival&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:23.400
of the country depends, which I don't believe for&nbsp;
a second. One of the things that they will rarely,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:31.980
if ever, admit, is that the war is extraordinarily&nbsp;
one sided in the sense that it is the retrograde&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:39.720
right wing that has chosen to fight these battles.&nbsp;
And it has been the left having no choice but to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:44.880
react and say, Hey, the things you're asking for&nbsp;
don't make sense. The battles you're choosing to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:50.820
fight are battles that we now have to get involved&nbsp;
in, not because we want to, but because you are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:57.600
trying to discriminate and under the law create&nbsp;
multiple tiers of people and so on and so forth.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:05.880
But they are suffering defeat after defeat. I told&nbsp;
you earlier this week that the Tennessee anti-drug&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:12.000
bill has been blocked. It does appear to violate&nbsp;
the First Amendment. We talked about a new Gallup&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:19.980
study that finds that support for gay marriage&nbsp;
is as high as ever in the United States. The Utah&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:27.780
book ban has backfired and actually led to the&nbsp;
Bible being banned. And even the Book of Mormon is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:34.560
now being looked at to say, hey, wait a second,&nbsp;
if we're banning sexual and violent content,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:40.560
don't these books also have to be banned? So it&nbsp;
has been failure after failure after failure,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:48.960
and we now have yet another defeat. A federal&nbsp;
judge has blocked Florida's ban on gender&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:56.040
affirming care for minors in a narrow ruling&nbsp;
and has stated gender identity is real. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.040 --> 00:02:02.820
Associated Press reports saying gender identity&nbsp;
is real. A federal judge temporarily blocked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:09.420
portions of a new Florida law that bans trans&nbsp;
minors from receiving puberty blockers ruling&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:15.540
Tuesday that the state has no rational basis&nbsp;
for denying patients treatment. They have many&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:22.980
irrational bases, but no rational basis. This is&nbsp;
a preliminary injunction from Judge Robert Hinkle,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:30.540
who says three trans kids can continue receiving&nbsp;
treatment. The lawsuit challenges the law that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:36.120
Governor Ron DeSantis signed the same week&nbsp;
he announced a run for president. Hinkle said&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:42.480
the elephant in the room should be noted at the&nbsp;
outset. Gender identity is real. The record makes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:49.380
this clear. Despite the defense admissions, there&nbsp;
are those who believe that cisgender individuals&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:55.500
properly adhere to their natal sex and that&nbsp;
trans individuals have inappropriately chosen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.500 --> 00:03:00.900
a contrary gender identity, male or female, just&nbsp;
as one might choose whether to read Shakespeare or&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:10.140
Grisham. This is extraordinarily important. Now,&nbsp;
I want to we've talked about so many different&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:15.480
aspects of this. And of course, this is only a&nbsp;
preliminary injunction or as Mike Pillow says&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:23.340
of Eliminare injunction, regardless of how you say&nbsp;
it, this is only a preliminary injunction and it's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:28.740
possible that the law may be upheld. I want to&nbsp;
talk about the religious component here with many&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.740 --> 00:03:34.200
of these issues, because when we talk about the&nbsp;
abortion bans, the attempts to ban gay marriage,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:38.880
the attempts to justify discrimination on the&nbsp;
basis of sexual orientation or gender identity,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:45.060
often there are religious justifications that&nbsp;
are cited. Now, we could talk about how these&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:49.440
anti-woke positions aren't actually the most&nbsp;
popular positions we could. There's all sorts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:53.940
of things we could talk about, but because we've&nbsp;
done that already, let me briefly address the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.940 --> 00:04:01.380
religious component to this. We often see&nbsp;
defenses or justifications for these laws&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:08.220
on religious grounds. And when I say religious&nbsp;
grounds, I'm talking about Christianity. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:14.100
when I say Christianity, I'm mostly talking about&nbsp;
evangelical Christianity, that those are that's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:21.780
the strong religious movement in this country&nbsp;
that is pushing most of this anti-woke stuff. I am&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:29.040
wondering whether it would be interesting to fight&nbsp;
some of these laws on the basis that they vow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:35.280
that they violate the religious beliefs of others.&nbsp;
I'll give you an example. According to Jewish law,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:41.460
human life begins at birth, not at&nbsp;
conception. It begins at the first breath.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:52.680
The majority of foundational Jewish texts say a&nbsp;
fetus does not attain personhood until birth. So&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:58.620
Judaism does not consider that life begins&nbsp;
at conception, but rather at the moment of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:07.440
of delivery. Could I or any other Jewish person&nbsp;
sue saying that anti-abortion bills violate their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.440 --> 00:05:12.720
religious beliefs? This has been mentioned before&nbsp;
and it would be an extraordinarily interesting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:19.680
path to approach, to take to approach fighting&nbsp;
some of these laws. Now, similarly, we can look at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:29.640
gender identity in many Jewish belief systems. It&nbsp;
is recognized that there are six distinct genders,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:38.100
including male, female and intersex identities.&nbsp;
Reform Judaism Advocates for Transgender Justice&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:42.840
affirms the value of all people, regardless of&nbsp;
gender identity. Now, of course, you could find&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:48.240
Orthodox Judaism, which would have a different&nbsp;
view. But is there not an argument to be made&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:54.120
that these anti-trans laws of all kinds,&nbsp;
whether it comes to gender affirming care&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:58.140
or whether it comes to pronouns or whether it&nbsp;
comes to bathrooms or whatever the case may be,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.140 --> 00:06:06.600
violates the religious beliefs and practices of&nbsp;
many Jewish movements, groups of Jews, sects,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:12.720
maybe they would be called. I think that there is&nbsp;
something here, and I know it's been mentioned in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.720 --> 00:06:18.000
passing by some rabbis, if they are going&nbsp;
to go the religious direction with this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:22.920
I would like to explore fighting them on&nbsp;
the same grounds. It's not going to be me&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:28.920
necessarily as a non-religious person. I consider&nbsp;
myself culturally, ethnically and call a narrowly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:37.080
Jewish for lack of a better term. But this really&nbsp;
should be looked at. And the if we want to find a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:42.240
silver lining in this entire culture war, war&nbsp;
that the right has unleashed upon the country,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:46.620
it's that they don't actually seem to have&nbsp;
the majority of the country on their side,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.620 --> 00:06:52.500
and also that they don't seem to have the law on&nbsp;
their side when it comes to what they're pushing.

